<title>NETHERLANDS: GOUDSMIT NINE-MONTH NET RISES 60 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>GOUDSMIT NINE-MONTH NET RISES 60 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     6.53 vs   4.08</p>
<p>    Net profit			     7.2  vs   4.5</p>
<p>    Turnover				86.3  vs  82.8</p>
<p>Third quarter to Sept 30, 1996:</p>
<p>    Net profit			     2.7  vs   1.6</p>
<p>Note - Retail and services group Goudsmit NV said in September it expected 1996 second half net profits to at least equal the year-ago period's result. In the first half of the year net profits grew by 55 percent to 4.5 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
